.DS_Store
node_modules/

# Secrets — never commit any .env anywhere (private keys, JWTs, RPC keys).
# Only the *.example templates are allowed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
# Per-network templates (.env.mainnet.example, ...). The `.example` suffix is the
# only thing that makes a .env file committable — a filled .env.mainnet stays ignored.
!.env.*.example
!**/.env.*.example
